{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Six hundred thousand men on foot.</b> And it will require much meat to satisfy them." "<b>And you said, \"Meat I will give them, and they shall eat a month of days.\"</b> And if so, the meat that You will give them must be exceedingly abundant, as it says: וַיַּמְטֵר עֲלֵיהֶם כֶּעָפָר שְׁאֵר וּכְחוֹל יַמִּים עוֹף כָּנָף (Psalms 78:27) — from every place."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:23.356652287Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}